# 75UR8000AUA, the US 75-inch UR80: the models DB lists it for this OTA ID (W23P 13.41.13.01).
# The default board (board_cmdline in guest/targets/soc/): the European board's line with the firmware's own US
# values. hwopt digit 0 5: hw-option-gen decodes countryType US, nyx-option-gen ATSC; every
# other field decodes as on the European line but the country's tuner flags.
# countryGrp 2: configd's USA RMM grpCode. tvregion ATSC: the broadcast system.
# ToolOpt: LLS's factory default record of this line, with the UR80/75" panelInch
# and toolType of the firmware's factory tables. Identity placeholders are replaced per VM.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=2
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=500200000003002000
ToolOpt=34755987:1323030:1083392:65:3679542:55823371
modelName=75UR8000AUA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=K8LPNA0
tvregion=ATSC
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
